  "solution": {
    "text": "Let equation of line is<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> ... <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Case-1: If both intercepts are positive<br />Then, <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> No value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> is possible (Discriminant is negative)<br />Case-2: If intercepts are of opposite sign, then <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> is possible hence <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> is possible<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;the sum of intercepts is equal to <math><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
